'''Trolly Blogger''' (はぐれたヤツ, ''Hagureta Yatsu'', '''Stray Guy''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[Those Guys]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]], [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], and [[The Aku Realms]]. He was added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]].

